00:50:20.510 --> 00:51:05.770
<v Jon Ronson>After several months emailing Stamps Man, we finally managed to convince him to tell us his story. It turns out that, after years obsessively collecting stamps and spending way too much money on it, he started to feel depressed and isolated. So he went to see a psychologist who told him stamp collecting is a ridiculous hobby because it's so solitary. And so now he pays porn people to destroy his stamps. He says he's had 10 books of stamps, and he's been destroying them in this way one at a time. And he's only got one book left, he says. He's deciding which custom producer to send it to. And after that, he's all done.
<v Jon Ronson>几个月后给“邮票男”发邮件，我们终于设法说服他告诉我们他的故事。事实证明，在痴迷收集邮票并为此花费太多钱多年后，他开始感到沮丧和孤立。所以他去看了一位心理学家，心理学家告诉他邮票收集是一种荒谬的爱好，因为它是如此孤独。所以现在他付钱给色情人员摧毁他的邮票。他说他有10本邮票，他一直以这种方式一次摧毁一本。他说他只剩下最后一本了。他正在决定把它寄给哪个定制制片人。在那之后，他就全完了。

00:51:05.770 --> 00:51:18.200
<v Jon Ronson>I thought I was done, too. I thought I'd learned all there was to learn about custom videos. But then I heard one more time from Dan and Rhiannon. Something had happened. They'd just received an email.
<v Jon Ronson>我觉得我也完了。我以为我已经学到了关于定制视频所能学到的一切。但后来我再次从丹和瑞安农那里听到了消息。发生了一些事。他们刚刚收到一封电子邮件。

00:51:18.200 --> 00:51:23.020
<v Rhiannon>It was about 4:00 or 5:00 AM. Dan received the email and read it.
<v Rhiannon>大约是凌晨4:00或5:00。丹收到了那封邮件并读了它。

00:51:23.020 --> 00:51:29.020
<v Dan>I kind of wanted to wake her up and show her because it's the most unique request we've had.
<v Dan>我有点想叫醒她给她看，因为这是我们收到过的最独特的要求。

00:51:29.020 --> 00:51:44.050
<v Jon Ronson>The email was requesting a porn star to sit cross-legged on the floor, fully clothed, and say into the camera, you are loved. Things are bad now, but they won't always be. Suicide is not the answer.
<v Jon Ronson>邮件要求一个色情明星交叉双腿坐在地板上，全副武装，对着镜头说，你被爱着。现在情况很糟糕，但不会永远这样。自杀不是答案。

00:51:44.050 --> 00:51:49.900
<v Rhiannon>It was just really heavy. And I wanted to make sure he's OK.
<v Rhiannon>这真的很沉重。我想确保他没问题。

00:51:49.900 --> 00:52:06.940
<v Dan>We basically handled it like a normal request and gave him model options and everything like that and told them we can shoot it really soon. And we haven't heard back.
<v Dan>我们基本上像对待正常要求一样处理它，给了他模特选项之类的一切，并告诉他们我们可以很快拍摄它。然后我们没收到回音。

00:52:06.940 --> 00:52:11.380
<v Jon Ronson>Dan and Rhiannon decided to shoot it anyway and send it to him.
<v Jon Ronson>丹和瑞安农还是决定拍摄它并寄给他。

00:52:11.380 --> 00:52:33.670
<v Rhiannon>The location that we're going to shoot at, there's so much natural light and it's up on the top of the hill, and the blue sky and everything, and everything is white-- white marble, white curtains, just bright white and brilliant. I don't know. We want it to just look beautiful.
<v Rhiannon>我们要拍摄的地方，有很多自然光，它在山顶上，蓝天什么的，一切都是白色的——白色大理石，白色窗帘，只是明亮的白色和灿烂。我不知道。我们只想让它看起来很美。

00:52:33.670 --> 00:52:53.980
<v Jon Ronson>It's the day of the shoot. Dan and Rhiannon and the porn performer, Riley Reyes, convene at the location. It's a sitting room in a mansion. There's a window facing a mountain and the valley and, probably because of all the recent rains in LA, everything outside is verdant. It looks like heaven from a film.
<v Jon Ronson>拍摄日。丹和瑞安农以及色情表演者莱利·雷耶斯在那个地点集合。这是一座豪宅里的客厅。有一扇对着山谷和山脉的窗户，大概因为洛杉矶最近所有的雨水，外面的东西都是青翠的。它看起来像电影里的天堂。

00:52:53.980 --> 00:52:59.280
<v Jon Ronson>Riley is 28. She's wearing bright pink jeggings and a bright blue tank top.
<v Jon Ronson>莱利28岁。她穿着亮粉色打底裤和亮蓝色背心。

00:52:59.280 --> 00:53:00.900
<v Riley Reyes>Do you mind if I read the email?
<v Riley Reyes>你介意我读这封邮件吗？

00:53:00.900 --> 00:53:03.430
<v Rhiannon>Oh, not at all. That's-- absolutely.
<v Rhiannon>哦，一点也不。那——绝对是。

00:53:03.430 --> 00:53:20.400
<v Jon Ronson>Dan and Rhiannon aren't charging the man. I'll call him Milo. They're not charging him for obvious reasons. And also because he still hasn't responded to their email. But they are paying Riley just like they would in a normal custom shoot. Riley is nervous.
<v Jon Ronson>丹和瑞安农没向那个男人收费。我会叫他米洛。他们没向他收费是有明显原因的。而且也是因为他仍然没有回复他们的邮件。但他们确实像在正常定制拍摄中一样给莱利报酬。莱利很紧张。

00:53:20.400 --> 00:53:21.820
<v Rhiannon>Are you OK?
<v Rhiannon>你还好吗？

00:53:21.820 --> 00:53:38.890
<v Riley Reyes>Mhm. Yeah. It's just that I think lots of people have lost friends this way, right? So it makes me think-- I hope he likes it. OK. I'm going to gather myself.
<v Riley Reyes>嗯。是的。只是我想很多人都以这种方式失去了朋友，对吧？所以它让我想到——我希望他喜欢它。好的。我要集中心思。

00:53:38.890 --> 00:53:43.960
<v Rhiannon>That's OK. Do whatever you need, sweet pea.
<v Rhiannon>没关系。做你需要做的任何事，甜心。

00:53:43.960 --> 00:54:05.840
<v Jon Ronson>I think it's safe to say that most people needing comfort wouldn't reach out to custom fetish porn producers, who the outside world might think of as cynical operators. But having been here a year, it makes so much sense to me. Custom producers are kind of like a family of outsiders themselves, and they often respond to their clients in the most sincere and heartfelt ways.
<v Jon Ronson>我认为可以肯定地说，大多数需要安慰的人不会联系定制恋物色情制片人，外界可能会认为他们是愤世嫉俗的操作者。但在这里待了一年，这对我来说很有意义。定制制片人本身有点像局外人的家庭，他们经常以最真诚和衷心的方式回应他们的客户。

00:54:05.840 --> 00:54:06.710
<v Dan>Let's do it.
<v Dan>我们开始吧。

00:54:06.710 --> 00:54:12.130
<v Rhiannon>OK. Camera ready. Yes?
<v Rhiannon>好的。相机准备好了。是吗？

00:54:12.130 --> 00:54:13.580
<v Rhiannon>[CLAPPER]
<v Rhiannon>[场记板]

00:54:13.580 --> 00:54:17.450
<v Rhiannon>Action.
<v Rhiannon>动作。

00:54:17.450 --> 00:54:59.360
<v Riley Reyes>It's Riley. You're going to be OK. It might not be great for a little bit, but it's all going to turn out OK. Life has its ups and downs. I've been low. I've been really low. I've-- I've thought about dying in the past. And at the time, it seemed-- it seemed like the only thing that made any sense. But I came back up out of the ashes, and I came back stronger. And every day now, I'm able-- able to see these little bits of beauty in the world around me and in the people who open their hearts to me. And that's-- and that's what's worth it.
<v Riley Reyes>我是莱利。你会没事的。可能会有一段时间不太好，但一切都会好起来的。生活有起有落。我也低落过。我曾经非常低落。我——我过去想过死。当时，它似乎——它似乎是唯一有意义的事情。但我从灰烬中又站了起来，我站起来时更坚强了。现在每天，我都能——能看到我周围世界和那些向我敞开心扉的人身上的一点点美。那就是——那就是值得的地方。

00:54:59.360 --> 00:55:27.260
<v Jon Ronson>Soon they'll send this video to Milo, even though they've heard nothing from him. It's a leap of faith. Everyone's just hoping that he doesn't do this to get off on it in some way. Everyone is also hoping that the reason why he's gone quiet is just because he's regretful or embarrassed or he's changed his mind. But then the video will arrive, and he'll watch it and maybe, in some small way, it will help.
<v Jon Ronson>很快他们就会把这段视频发给米洛，尽管他们没从他那里听到任何消息。这是信任的飞跃。每个人都只是希望他不是为了某种方式得到释放而这样做。每个人也希望他沉默的原因只是因为他后悔、尴尬或改变了主意。但视频会到达，他会看它，也许，以某种微小的方式，它会有所帮助。

00:55:27.260 --> 00:55:28.550
<v Riley Reyes>Stick with us.
<v Riley Reyes>请继续收听。

00:55:28.550 --> 00:55:38.110
<v Riley Reyes>[KISSES]
<v Riley Reyes>[吻声]

